rom other cases. That is why every case has additional identification and is easy to identify. It is unchallenging to tell where the respondent field is assigned. If you have confused about the Court case number, then you need to help of the Clerk of Court. The clerks are ready to help people are finding the court case number.</p>\n</div></div>\n\n</div></div>\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<style>.kb-row-layout-id3429_318e52-86 > .kt-row-column-wrap{align-content:start;}:where(.kb-row-layout-id3429_318e52-86 > .kt-row-column-wrap) > .wp-block-kadence-column{justify-content:start;}.kb-row-layout-id3429_318e52-86 > .kt-row-column-wrap{column-gap:var(--global-kb-gap-md, 2rem);row-gap:var(--global-kb-gap-md, 2rem);padding-top:0px;padding-bottom:0px;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));}.kb-row-layout-id3429_318e52-86 > .kt-row-layout-overlay{opacity:0.30;}@media all and (max-width: 1024px){.kb-row-layout-id3429_318e52-86 > .kt-row-column-wrap{grid-template-columns:repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));}}@media all and (max-width: 767px){.kb-row-layout-id3429_318e52-86 > .kt-row-column-wrap{grid-template-columns:minmax(0, 1fr);}}</style><div class=\"kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id3429_318e52-86 alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout\"><div class=\"kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-2-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top\">\n<style>.kadence-column3429_a07c68-eb > .kt-inside-inner-col,.kadence-column3429_a07c68-eb > .kt-inside-inner-col:before{border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;}.kadence-column3429_a07c68-eb > .kt-inside-inner-col{column-gap:var(--global-kb-gap-sm, 1rem);}.kadence-column3429_a07c68-eb > .kt-inside-inner-col{flex-direction:column;}.kadence-column3429_a07c68-eb > .kt-inside-inner-col > .aligncenter{width:100%;}.kadence-column3429_a07c68-eb > .kt-inside-inner-col:before{opacity:0.